    "directions": [
      "In a bowl add guava, salt, sugar, vinegar, red chilli powder and mix everything properly and keep aside for further use.",
      "In a kadai heat oil and add ginger, black pepper cons, cloves saute for a minute.",
      "Then add the guava mixture, water, cover and cook on low flame for 15-20 minutes.",
      "Remove the lid and add guava juice and continue cooking for 5-10 or until soft and thick.",
      "Now add the coriander stems and cook for 2 minutes, switch off the flames and let it cool down.",
      "Store in the fridge in a airtight container."
    ],
